caption: Mastery Requirements
tradition-component: mastery-requirements

Possess one Innovator Tradition Path. Master 10 spell-enhancement techniques, fully buying off each technique’s penalty so that the enhanced spell’s effective skill equals the Innovator’s skill in the relevant College. Teach an Enhanced Spell to someone. Have all 27 vanilla GURPS Magic College skills at 16 or better. Invent a spell.
